# OCI labels for the GHCR package card.
#
# The package page at github.com/AEON-7/vllm-ultimate-dgx-spark/pkgs/container/aeon-vllm-ultimate
# renders ONLY org.opencontainers.image.description -- it currently shows no README because
# org.opencontainers.image.source is not set, which is what links a package to its repo and
# makes GitHub render that repo's README on the package page. Setting it fixes both problems.
#
# Build:  docker build -f Dockerfile.labels -t aeon-vllm-ultimate:0.29.0-omni-dflash2 \
#           --build-arg BASE=aeon-vllm-ultimate:0.29.0-omni-dflash2 .
ARG BASE=aeon-vllm-ultimate:0.29.0-omni-dflash2
FROM ${BASE}

LABEL org.opencontainers.image.title="AEON vLLM Ultimate (omni)"
LABEL org.opencontainers.image.source="https://github.com/AEON-7/vllm-ultimate-dgx-spark"
LABEL org.opencontainers.image.documentation="https://github.com/AEON-7/vllm-ultimate-dgx-spark/blob/main/docs/RELEASE-0.29.0-omni.md"
LABEL org.opencontainers.image.licenses="Apache-2.0"
LABEL org.opencontainers.image.version="0.29.0-omni"
LABEL org.opencontainers.image.base.name="nvidia/cuda:13.0.2-base-ubuntu22.04"
LABEL org.opencontainers.image.vendor="AEON-7"

LABEL org.opencontainers.image.description="AEON vLLM Ultimate 0.29.0-omni - vLLM 0.29.0 built from source for DGX Spark / Blackwell (sm_121a/GB10, aarch64, CUDA 13). \
ONE IMAGE for text, vision, audio-in and SPEECH-OUT. \
OMNI STACK: vllm-omni (0.29-compatible revision) layered in, so Thinker/Talker/Code2Wav speech synthesis works (stock vLLM strips the voice half via skip_prefixes) - 10 speech-output families registered incl. Qwen3-Omni, MiniCPM-o 4.5, Step-Audio 2, plus the Qwen3-TTS voice store with zero-shot cloning and voice design. \
AUDIO-IN: PyAV + soundfile + librosa + soxr baked in, with a gate that forces a real 24kHz->16kHz resample. \
SPECULATIVE DECODING, all families in one image: DFlash 2 (upstream PR #52816 cherry-picked - first 0.29.0 image to ship it, incl. BOTH the layer_type forward and the is_causal precedence fix without which DFlash2 silently degrades to DFlash1), DFlash, DSpark quantized Markov heads, MTP self-spec, Eagle/Eagle3. \
LONG CONTEXT: 1M on Qwen3.8-27B via official YaRN factor 4.0 (needle-verified 3/3 at 272K and 544K). Note rope_parameters must nest under text_config or the override is a silent no-op. \
TP=2 over RoCE with cross-node CUDA graphs - capture AND replay, contradicting upstream #46253; the load-bearing carry is #48053 thread_local, NOT NCCL 2.30.7 (this image runs 2.29.7, there is no 2.30.x floor). RDMA proven by counters: 3210 MB port_xmit_data vs 0 MB TCP. \
ALSO: Triton NVFP4-KV (NHD-safe, no as_strided), mistral_common>=1.11.6 fix (every prior image shipped 1.11.1 and broke vllm.tokenizers.mistral), SLIM rebase 18.3 GB vs 50.6 GB. \
GOTCHA WORTH KNOWING: with spec decode you must set attention_backend INSIDE --speculative-config or FlashInfer silently downgrades FULL_AND_PIECEWISE cudagraphs to PIECEWISE. Healthy signature: 6 FULL + 13 PIECEWISE. \
Full release notes: docs/RELEASE-0.29.0-omni.md"
